sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Model
    participant C as Code in container
    participant E as Your executor
    M->>C: writes a program
    loop each tool call in the code
        C->>E: API pauses: tool_use, caller = code
        E->>E: validate and run
        E->>C: tool_result blocks only
    end
    C->>M: printed lines only
